  "description": "The proposed works include replacing all existing timber sash and timber casement windows with new double-glazed timber sash and casement units. To the rear, existing timber sash and casement windows will be replaced with uPVC mock sash and uPVC casement windows. The existing timber rear door will be replaced with a new uPVC-framed door, while the front entrance door will undergo repairs and redecoration. All uPVC gutters and downpipes to the front and rear elevations will be renewed, along with the redecoration of existing soffits and fascias. Necessary repairs to the external render and pointing will be carried out, and the secondary roof will receive an LPL overlay.",
